    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a cooking recipe. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Bedrock records neither an experience reward nor a cooking time on the recipe itself, so neither is reported here. The experience a smelt awards belongs to the input item, and the time a cook takes to the station. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
